      <section
        class="py-24 px-6 scroll-mt-16"
        id="faq"
      >
        <div
          class="max-w-3xl mx-auto"
        >
          <h2
            class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-stone-900 text-center mb-10"
          >
            Frequently asked questions
          </h2>
          <div
            class="space-y-3"
          >
            <details
              class="group rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 p-5"
            >
              <summary
                class="font-bold text-stone-900 cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
              >
                Is Oopsly free?
                <span
                  class="text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform text-xl leading-none"
                >
                  +
                </span>
              </summary>
              <p
                class="mt-3 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed"
              >
                Yes. The Basic plan is free and includes up to 3 decks with FSRS scheduling and basic stats. Upgrade whenever you need more.
              </p>
            </details>
            <details
              class="group rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 p-5"
            >
              <summary
                class="font-bold text-stone-900 cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
              >
                What is spaced repetition?
                <span
                  class="text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform text-xl leading-none"
                >
                  +
                </span>
              </summary>
              <p
                class="mt-3 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed"
              >
                A study method that shows you each card just before you would forget it. FSRS is a modern scheduler that models your memory per card, so you review less and remember more.
              </p>
            </details>
            <details
              class="group rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 p-5"
            >
              <summary
                class="font-bold text-stone-900 cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
              >
                Can I bring my existing questions?
                <span
                  class="text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform text-xl leading-none"
                >
                  +
                </span>
              </summary>
              <p
                class="mt-3 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed"
              >
                Yes. Test suites accept bulk imports from CSV, Excel or pasted text, with a preview before anything is added.
              </p>
            </details>
            <details
              class="group rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 p-5"
            >
              <summary
                class="font-bold text-stone-900 cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
              >
                Does it work offline?
                <span
                  class="text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform text-xl leading-none"
                >
                  +
                </span>
              </summary>
              <p
                class="mt-3 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed"
              >
                Yes. Keep studying without a connection and your progress syncs when you are back online.
              </p>
            </details>
            <details
              class="group rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 p-5"
            >
              <summary
                class="font-bold text-stone-900 cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center"
              >
                Can I switch or cancel my plan?
                <span
                  class="text-stone-400 group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform text-xl leading-none"
                >
                  +
                </span>
              </summary>
              <p
                class="mt-3 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed"
              >
                You can change plans from the subscription page at any time.
              </p>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
